// Windows 12 service worker.
//
// Two jobs:
//   1. Offline precache of the shell (core CSS/JS + builtin app entries).
//   2. Virtual package host: serve /js/apps/<id>/… for INSTALLED packages
//      straight out of the virtual filesystem (OPFS), so store apps run
//      from disk after the Store downloads them.
//
// The app distribution map and the builtin precache list below are
// GENERATED by build-registry.js — do not hand-edit those blocks.

